<title>ITALY: Italian total bank lending rose 2.4 pct in May.</title>
<headline>Italian total bank lending rose 2.4 pct in May.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian total bank lending rose 2.4 percent year-on-year in May, the Bank of Italy said in a statement. It issued the following provisional year-on-year percentage changes:</p>
<p>			  May 97	April 1997    May 1996</p>
<p>Total bank lending  +2.4	    +3.3%	   +3.0%</p>
<p>Lira bank lending   +2.8	    +3.4%	   +5.9%</p>
<p>Deposits		-2.2	    -0.5%	   +4.4%</p>
</text>
